## megatron_lm_fl/05_expert_parallelism.md (604 lines)
L1: 05 - Expert Parallelism (EP) & Mixture-of-Experts 源码深度分析
  L3: 源码位置
  L15: 1. MoE 层架构与执行流程
    L17: 1.1 MoELayer 四阶段 Pipeline (moe_layer.py L532-633)
L20: moe_layer.py L532
    L52: 1.2 完整数据流 ASCII 图
  L112: 2. TopKRouter 路由机制 (router.py L144-763)
    L114: 2.1 完整路由流程
L117: router.py L664-763: TopKRouter.routing()
    L163: 2.2 负载均衡策略详解
    L175: 2.3 Grouped TopK Routing (DeepSeek-V3 风格)
L178: topk_routing_with_score_function 支持的参数:
L179: num_groups: 将 experts 分为 G 组
L180: group_topk: 先选 top-G_k 组, 再在组内选 top-k experts
L181: scaling_factor: 归一化 topk 权重
L183: 流程:
L184: 1. logits [tokens, E] → reshape [tokens, G, E/G]
L185: 2. group_scores = max(scores_per_group) → top-G_k 组选择
L186: 3. 在选中的组内: top-k expert selection
L187: 4. scaling: probs *= scaling_factor / sum(probs)
    L190: 2.4 Hash Routing (DSv4-Pro, router.py L623-663)
  L213: 3. Token Dispatcher 深度分析
    L215: 3.1 AlltoAll Dispatcher 七步工作流 (token_dispatcher.py L357-865)
    L228: 3.2 Permutation 详解
L231: dispatch_preprocess (L605-660):
L232: Permutation 1: 将 tokens 按 routing_map 中 expert 分配排序
L241: 结果: tokens 按 [expert_0_tokens, expert_1_tokens, ..., expert_E_tokens] 排列
L242: reversed_mapping: 用于 combine 阶段恢复原始顺序
L244: dispatch_postprocess (L691-760):
L245: Permutation 2: 将 all-to-all 后的 tokens 按 LOCAL expert 排序
L246: 因为 A2A 后的布局是 [from_rank_0, from_rank_1, ...], 每段内含多个 expert
L247: 需要 transpose 为 [expert_0_all_ranks, expert_1_all_ranks, ...]
    L256: 3.3 AlltoAll 通信细节
L259: token_dispatch (L662-689):
    L273: 3.4 TP×EP 联合通信模式
    L292: 3.5 CUDA DtoH 同步优化 (L438-601)
L295: 关键优化: AlltoAll 需要 CPU 端的 split sizes, 但计算在 GPU 上
L296: 直接 DtoH 同步会阻塞 → 使用专用 stream 异步拷贝
L300: 5 个同步点 (按优先级):
L301: "before_permutation_1" → 最早同步 (最安全)
L302: "before_ep_alltoall"   → AlltoAll 前同步 (CUDAGraph 需要)
L303: "before_permutation_2" → 第二次 permute 前
L304: "before_finish"        → 最终输出前
L305: "no_sync"              → 不需要同步 (drop_and_pad 模式)
L307: 异步 DtoH 拷贝:
L312: 在 sync point 处: cuda_dtoh_stream.synchronize()
    L315: 3.6 DeepEP 集成 (_DeepepManager, L1109-1300)
    L344: 3.7 Flex Dispatcher (L1347-1547)
  L365: 4. Shared Expert 与通信-计算 Overlap
    L367: 4.1 Overlap 机制 (moe_layer.py L320-321, token_dispatcher.py L638, L704, L844-864)
    L399: 4.2 backward_dw 分离 (moe_layer.py L634-654)
  L418: 5. Latent Projection — 通信量压缩 (moe_layer.py L246-276)
L421: 设计动机: AlltoAll 通信量 ∝ hidden_size
L422: Latent projection: H → latent_size (降维), 通信后再 latent_size → H (升维)
L423: 通信量减少: hidden_size / latent_size 倍
L431: 数据流:
L432: [S×B, H] → fc1_latent → [S×B, latent] → AlltoAll → Expert → AlltoAll → fc2_latent → [S×B, H]
L433: 通信量: 2 × S×B × latent_size × dtype (vs 原始 2 × S×B × H × dtype)
  L438: 6. 通信量量化分析
    L440: 6.1 AlltoAll 通信量
    L460: 6.2 Latent Projection 的通信收益
    L470: 6.3 Shared Expert Overlap 收益
